sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Admin as Super Admin<br/>Management App
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>Platform API
  participant SaaS as SaaS<br/>tenant/subscription owner
  participant Authz as Authorizer<br/>identity contract
  participant UserAccess as User-Access<br/>profile contract
  participant Payment as Payment<br/>settings owner
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>tenant.created
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>tenant seed consumer

  Admin->>BFF: Onboard tenant
  BFF->>SaaS: Verified onboarding command
  SaaS->>SaaS: Create tenant<br/>and initial subscription
  SaaS->>Authz: Create owner identity
  SaaS->>UserAccess: Upsert owner profile and roles
  SaaS->>Payment: Create empty payment settings
  SaaS-->>BFF: Tenant and owner created
  BFF-->>Admin: Onboarding success
  SaaS-->>Kafka: Publish tenant.created after commit
  Kafka-->>Catalog: Seed default tenant data idempotently

  opt Failure after side effects
    SaaS->>Authz: Disable owner identity
    SaaS->>SaaS: Remove initial subscription<br/>and partial tenant
    SaaS-->>BFF: Onboarding failed
  end

  Note over SaaS,Payment: SaaS coordinates by contract<br/>It does not write Authorizer, User-Access, Payment or Catalog databases directly
